# Devices publish readings and listen for commands.
user device
topic write sensors/#
topic read actuators/#

# Claude reads everything the devices report and may command actuators. Which
# actuator topics it can actually publish to is narrowed further in the
# plugin's config.toml ([[ming.mqtt]] publish).
user claude
topic read sensors/#
topic readwrite actuators/#

# Node-RED bridges device readings into InfluxDB and sends actuator commands
# (the greenhouse demo). Created by demo/setup.sh; unused until then.
user nodered
topic read sensors/#
topic write actuators/#
